        "content": "Graph approved. Before I write the script, here's the story I'd tell. Please confirm or change it.\n\n- **Audience:** People who use the app, not its developers.\n- **Shape:** Problem, how it works, outcome. It opens on the forgotten password and ends with the user signed in with a new password.\n- **Hook:** \"Someone can't remember their password.\"\n- **Takeaway:** The reset link works once, and only for an hour.\n\nShould I use this story? If so, I'll save it as the brief and then write the scenes and narration.",
